SUMMARY:Manon - Royal Ballet & Opera 26-27 Season @ WTW Truro
DESCRIPTION:Manon - Royal Ballet & Opera 26-27 Season (3h 10min)\n\nIn the 
 seedy underbelly of 18th-century Paris\, money is king. Nothing is sacred 
 – even love itself can be bought for the right price. A native of this hed
 onistic underworld\, Manon is caught between twin desires when she falls i
 n love with the student Des Grieux. Steadfast and devoted\, he offers the 
 possibility of an honourable life. Yet\, the riches promised by the world 
 of Parisian society remain tempting...\nManon's inner turmoil and struggl
 e for survival lie at the devastating heart of Kenneth MacMillan's 1974 ad
 aptation of Abbé Prévost's novel. In this signature work of The Royal Ball
 et\, MacMillan's nuanced understanding of human psychology makes for an un
 flinching look into the moral degradation of Manon's Paris\, while all its
  decadence and decay are brought to life through Jules Massenet's score an
 d Nicholas Georgiadis's designs.\n\nFilm release at WTW Cinemas Truro\nBoo
 k tickets: https://wtwcinemas.co.uk/truro/film/5556/manon-royal-ballet-ope
 ra-2627-season\n\nFilm details: https://evenwebb.github.io/wtw-cinemas/fil
 ms/manon-royal-ballet-opera-26-27-season.html
LOCATION:WTW Cinemas Truro
URL:https://wtwcinemas.co.uk/truro/film/5556/manon-royal-ballet-opera-2627-
 season
SEQUENCE:0
END:VEVENT
