 strange creatures. She’s swept off her feet by the charming Knave of Heart
 s\, who’s on the run for stealing the tarts. Confusion piles upon confusio
 n. Then Alice wakes with a start. Was it all a daydream?\n\nFilm release a
 t WTW Cinemas Truro\nBook tickets: https://wtwcinemas.co.uk/truro/film/556
